§§ `Disability allowances (Sch 1 Pt 5) -- for an injured person who cannot work or keep house`

-- Which allowances: an employee who also keeps house; not in business.
#ASSERT (`Which disability allowances could apply to me` TRUE FALSE TRUE 52 FALSE FALSE TRUE)'s `an employed person's allowance may apply`
#ASSERT (`Which disability allowances could apply to me` TRUE FALSE TRUE 52 FALSE FALSE TRUE)'s `a housekeeping allowance may apply`
#ASSERT NOT ((`Which disability allowances could apply to me` TRUE FALSE TRUE 52 FALSE FALSE TRUE)'s `a self-employed person's replacement allowance may apply`)
