#ASSERT `an employee's allowance` `for less than one week before the accident` 0 `the accident` 401 0 TRUE `none` 0 FALSE EQUALS `weekly allowance` `an employed person's allowance` 320.8 320.8 (DATE_FROM_DMY 17 3 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 6 3 2028) (DATE_FROM_DMY 3 3 2031)
-- AWE $8 000: 80% is $6 400, more than 3 x $2 000: $6 000.
