    `age in years on the day of the death` IS 5
    `would, but for the death, be wholly or partly dependent on the person for financial support` IS TRUE
    `would, but for the death, be wholly or partly dependent on the person for care other than financial support` IS TRUE
    `has a spouse` IS FALSE
    `is a full-time student` IS FALSE
    `ordinarily resided with the person at the same premises` IS TRUE
    `was principally dependent on the person for financial support` IS TRUE
    `is the parent or step-parent of a dependent child who would, but for the death, be dependent on the person for care` IS FALSE
    `was born from a pregnancy at the time of the accident` IS FALSE
    `survived the person by the cl 7 period of 30 days` IS TRUE
`the child of 17` MEANS `Survivor` WITH
    `relationship to the person who died` IS `a child of theirs, or of a marriage or significant relationship they were a party to`
    `age in years on the day of the death` IS 17
    `would, but for the death, be wholly or partly dependent on the person for financial support` IS TRUE
    `would, but for the death, be wholly or partly dependent on the person for care other than financial support` IS FALSE
